on server list ping:
	set fake max players count to 2025
	set motd to minimessage from "               <b><gradient:#1685FF:#16E3FF>50xCreative</gradient></b> <dark_gray>| <white>1.13 - 1.21.8<newline>       <#A54BFF>ᴄʀᴇᴀᴛɪᴠᴇ <gray>• <#FF47FB>ᴘʟᴏᴛs <gray>• <#FF5454>ᴇᴄᴏɴᴏᴍʏ <gray>• <#FF9947>ʀᴏʟᴇᴘʟᴀʏ"

